          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "(1)で正のn乗根を定義し、(2)では両辺のn乗が同じで、どちらも正であることを確認します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問 解答",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) n乗するとaになる数のうち、正の数をn乗根とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt[n]{a}>0,\\qquad (\\sqrt[n]{a})^n=a",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) まず2つの式をn乗すると、どちらもa^mになります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(\\sqrt[n]{a^m})^n=a^m",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "((\\sqrt[n]{a})^m)^n=((\\sqrt[n]{a})^n)^m=a^m",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "両者はともに正なので、a^mの正のn乗根として一致します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt[n]{a^m}=(\\sqrt[n]{a})^m",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "(1)〜(3)は端の固定と重複順列です。(4)(5)はcを除いたa,bの並びを先に考え、隣接する同じ文字の間へcを入れます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 解答一覧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ア 4200"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "イ 1260"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "ウ 560"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "エ 1"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "オ 10"
              },
              {
                "label": "(5)",
                "value": "カ 36"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) a3個、b4個、c3個の重複順列です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{10!}{3!4!3!}=4200",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) 左端のaを固定し、残り9文字を並べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{9!}{2!4!3!}=1260",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "st-marianna-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (3)〜(5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(3) 左端a・右端bを固定し、残るa2個、b3個、c3個を並べます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{8!}{2!3!3!}=560",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(4) aabbbabでは、aaとbbの間へ3個のcを入れる位置が1通りに決まります。ababbabでは中央のbbの間へ1個を入れ、残り2個をほかの5か所から選びます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1,\\qquad {}_5C_2=10",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(5) 先頭a・末尾bを固定し、残るa2個とb3個の並び10通りを、同じ文字の隣接箇所数で分類します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_5C_2=10",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "st-marianna-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "隣接箇所が4以上の型は0通り、3か所の型は6個、1か所の型は3個あり、それぞれcの入れ方が0、1、10通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1\\cdot6+10\\cdot3=36",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "t=sin xで絶対値の中を2次式にし、符号で場合分けします。最後はtの解1個がxの解何個へ戻るかを数えます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 解答一覧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "キ \\(-\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ク \\(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "ケ 5"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "コ \\(-2\\sqrt{3}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "サ 3"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "シ \\(2\\sqrt{3}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "ス 4"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "t=sin xとすると、cos2x=1-2t²より次の形です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=4t+|3-4t^2|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "3-4t²が0以上の範囲では、絶対値を外すと-4t²+4t+3になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\le t\\le\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2つの2次関数の枝と端点を比べると、最大値は5、最小値は-2√3です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "st-marianna-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (3)・(4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-graph-abs-quadratic",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "t=0には0≤x≤2πで3個のxが対応するため、y=3との共有点は3個です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\sqrt3<k<4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "(1)は2つのrを等置します。(2)(3)はr²=x²+y²、rsinθ=y、rcosθ=xを使います。(4)は対称性を利用して差を積分します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問 解答一覧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "セ \\(\\dfrac{3\\pi}{4}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ソ \\(\\dfrac{7\\pi}{4}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "タ \\(\\dfrac{1}{4}x^{2}-1\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "チ \\(-\\dfrac{1}{4}y^{2}+1\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "ツ \\(1-x\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) 2つの動径を等置するとsinθ=-cosθです。0≤θ<2πより偏角を決め、rへ戻します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\theta=\\frac{3\\pi}{4},\\quad\\frac{7\\pi}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=4+2\\sqrt2,\\quad4-2\\sqrt2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) r-rsinθ=2へr=√(x²+y²)、rsinθ=yを入れて2乗します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=\\frac14x^2-1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(3) 同様にr+rcosθ=2を変換します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=-\\frac14y^2+1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=2\\sqrt{1-x}\\quad\\text{または}\\quad y=-2\\sqrt{1-x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "st-marianna-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問 (4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "C1とC2は直線y=-xに関して対称です。交点のx座標をα=-2√2-2、β=2√2-2とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a4-area-c1-c2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=2\\int_{\\alpha}^{\\beta}\\left(-x-\\left(\\frac14x^2-1\\right)\\right)dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac12\\int_{\\alpha}^{\\beta}(x-\\alpha)(\\beta-x)dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac1{12}(\\beta-\\alpha)^3=\\frac{32\\sqrt2}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a4-unit-circle-line",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "st-marianna-2025-general-early-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問の変換確認",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "極方程式から直交座標へ移るときは、2乗前の右辺が非負である条件も確認します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}=y+2,\\qquad y\\ge-2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}=2-x,\\qquad x\\le2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
